      "items": [
        {
          "published_at": "2026-11-26T02:31:52.532Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/karpathy/status/2125779541952246039",
          "topic": "Long-running agent builds a real-data Civilization map",
          "text": "I asked Claude to populate a Civilization-style game map with real data from the US. Opus 5.5 downloaded and parse a ton of public data and 7 hours and 45K lines of code later... it works :)\n\n- 31 real data sources including Census, BEA, BLS, EIA, NOAA, USGS, DoD, NPS, FAA, FEMA, CDC...\n- Real elevation, land cover, GDP, jobs, power plants, mines, ports, airports, bases, parks, universities, freight flows, disasters; all reconciled onto one 25 km hex grid.\n- The data is converted into Civilization language, e.g. Gold yield is GDP. A city's districts are its real industry specializations: San Jose gets a Campus, Detroit is \"Motor city\". Its citizens are its real workforce: 1 in 4 San Jose workers are engineers, coders or scientists, against 1 in 14 nationally. Wonders are chosen by published rules, such as national parks by visitor numbers and universities by R&D spending, etc etc.\n- 19 lenses (income, degrees, faith, disasters…), a City View for 524 metros, and nine advisors plus an Explorer. The Explorer turns any column for any of 3,100+ counties into a table and scatter plot, linked to the map.\n- Claude decided to skip a few states and territories sry\n- Built using Claude Code desktop app, Opus 5.5 on medium and turning on ultracode.\n\nIt's deployed here: karpathy.ai/usaciv/ and the \"?\" has the source link too. I don't exactly know where I was going with this but it's really fun to browse and play with. Possibly it can be expanded or built into a game. I only have half of my weekly Claude quote left though so someone else will have to take over :D. Claude also made a trailer:",
          "attachments": [
            {
              "type": "native_video",
              "poster_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2125775560517570561/img/GDE8h47dSgwy5uSy?format=jpg&name=medium",
              "external_url": "https://x.com/karpathy/status/2125779541952246039",
              "width": 1200,
              "height": 675
            }
          ],
